            "content": "On November 7, 2024, Douglas Herrington, CEO Worldwide Amazon Stores, adopted a trading plan intended to satisfy Rule 10b5-1(c) to sell up to 158,970 shares of Amazon.com, Inc. common stock over a period ending on December 31, 2025, subject to certain conditions.",
